< Proposed Pipeline (Implementation) >
 1) 이미지 입력 (Grayscale Left Camera)
 2) Feature Detection
  - ORB 키포인트 추출
 3) Feature Matching
  - BFMatcher (Hamming distance)
 4) Essential Matrix 계산
  - 5-point algorithm (RANSAC)
 5) recoverPose로 R, t 추정
 6) GT 기반 Scale Estimation
  - Scale ambiguity 해결
 7) Pose 누적 (Pose Propagation)
 8) Trajectory 생성 및 Plot
 9) 정량평가 (APE/RPE) – 현재는 APE만 측정
 
 (사진 - 전체 파이프라인 Flow Chart (Camera → ORB → Matching → Essential → RecoverPose → Scale → Pose Accumulation → Trajectory))
 


 
